{"seq":3,"slug":"planning-decision","title":"规划与决策算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/planning-decision","wordCount":1418,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"规划与决策算法\">规划与决策算法</h1><p>当感知系统告诉自动驾驶车辆&quot;前方 50 米有一辆公交车正在进站，左侧车道有一辆轿车以 40 km/h 平行行驶，后方 30 米有一辆跟车&quot;时，规划模块必须在 100 毫秒内回答一个问题：<strong>接下来 5 秒内，我的车应该走一条什么样的轨迹？</strong> 这条轨迹必须同时满足不碰撞、不违章、不让乘客不适、不浪费时间——四个约束中任何一个的失败都可能导致事故或糟糕的体验。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>轨迹规划可形式化为约束优化问题。给定当前状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_0</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、目标状态 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>T</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_T</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、障碍物集合 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\mathcal{O}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span></span></span></span></span>，求解最优轨迹 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">.</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>T</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau^* = \\{s_1, s_2, ..., s_T\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6887em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">...</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>τ</mi><mo>∗</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>arg</mi><mo>⁡</mo><munder><mrow><mi>min</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mi>τ</mi></munder><msubsup><mo>∫</mo><mn>0</mn><mi>T</mi></msubsup><mi>C</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> </mtext><mi>d</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\tau^* = \\arg\\min_\\tau \\int_0^T C(s_t, a_t) \\, dt</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7387em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">∗</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.5032em;vertical-align:-0.9119em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">ar<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop op-limits\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6679em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4em;margin-left:0em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1132em;\">τ</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span><span class=\"mop\">min</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.7em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol large-op\" style=\"margin-right:0.4445em;position:relative;top:-0.0011em;\">∫</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.5912em;\"><span style=\"top:-1.7881em;margin-left:-0.4445em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.8129em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9119em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>subject to:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>动力学约束：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>s</mi><mrow><mi>t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mi>f</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s_{t+1} = f(s_t, a_t)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6389em;vertical-align:-0.2083em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">+</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2083em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>碰撞约束：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"script\">O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>&gt;</mo><msub><mi>d</mi><mrow><mi>s</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>f</mi><mi>e</mi></mrow></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∀</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d(s_t, \\mathcal{O}) &gt; d_{safe}, \\forall t</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathcal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9805em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">e</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∀</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span></span></span></span></span></li>\n<li>运动学约束：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>κ</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>κ</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|\\kappa_t| \\leq \\kappa_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">κ</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>（曲率限制）</li>\n<li>舒适约束：<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>a</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|a_{lat}| \\leq a_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5806em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><msub><mi>j</mi><mi>t</mi></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">∣</mi><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>j</mi><mrow><mi>m</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">|j_t| \\leq j_{max}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">t</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.854em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0572em;\">j</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0572em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">ma</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 是代价函数，通常是时间、加速度变化率、偏离参考线距离的加权和。</p>\n<h2 id=\"三代规划架构对比\">三代规划架构对比</h2><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    subgraph gen1[&quot;第一代-基于规则&quot;]&#10;        A1[场景分类] --&gt; B1[if-else 规则树] --&gt; C1[固定模板轨迹]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph gen2[&quot;第二代-优化搜索&quot;]&#10;        A2[代价地图] --&gt; B2[采样与搜索] --&gt; C2[最优轨迹]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph gen3[&quot;第三代-学习驱动&quot;]&#10;        A3[场景特征] --&gt; B3[神经网络] --&gt; C3[轨迹分布]&#10;    end\">graph LR\n    subgraph gen1[\"第一代-基于规则\"]\n        A1[场景分类] --&gt; B1[if-else 规则树] --&gt; C1[固定模板轨迹]\n    end\n    subgraph gen2[\"第二代-优化搜索\"]\n        A2[代价地图] --&gt; B2[采样与搜索] --&gt; C2[最优轨迹]\n    end\n    subgraph gen3[\"第三代-学习驱动\"]\n        A3[场景特征] --&gt; B3[神经网络] --&gt; C3[轨迹分布]\n    end</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>代际</th>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>优势</th>\n<th>劣势</th>\n<th>代表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>第一代</td>\n<td>有限状态机 + 规则</td>\n<td>可解释、确定性</td>\n<td>无法覆盖长尾、僵硬</td>\n<td>早期 Waymo</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第二代</td>\n<td>格点搜索 / 采样优化</td>\n<td>全局最优性、约束硬保证</td>\n<td>计算量大、高维诅咒</td>\n<td>Lattice Planner, iLQR</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>第三代</td>\n<td>神经网络直接输出</td>\n<td>灵活、隐式学习社交规范</td>\n<td>可解释性差、安全不可证明</td>\n<td>UniAD, GameFormer</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2026 年的实际系统通常是<strong>第三代 + 安全层</strong>的混合：神经网络生成多条候选轨迹，安全检查模块对每条轨迹做碰撞检测和规则验证，选择既高效又安全的那条。</p>\n<h2 id=\"行为预测与交互建模\">行为预测与交互建模</h2><p>规划不能在真空中进行——其他道路参与者会对自车行为做出反应。预测与规划的关系有三种范式：</p>\n<p><strong>序列式</strong>：先预测其他车辆未来轨迹（固定），再基于预测结果做规划。问题：忽略了&quot;我的行为会影响他人&quot;的交互效应。</p>\n<p><strong>联合式</strong>：同时预测所有参与者的未来行为和自车轨迹。代表：UniAD 的联合预测-规划模块。</p>\n<p><strong>博弈式</strong>：将多车交互建模为博弈论问题，每个参与者都在最大化自己的效用。代表：GameFormer 用 Transformer 建模多智能体博弈均衡。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[当前场景] --&gt; B{交互模型}&#10;    B --&gt;|序列式| C[预测他人 → 自车规划]&#10;    B --&gt;|联合式| D[多主体联合轨迹分布]&#10;    B --&gt;|博弈式| E[纳什均衡求解]&#10;    C --&gt; F[执行轨迹]&#10;    D --&gt; F&#10;    E --&gt; F\">graph TD\n    A[当前场景] --&gt; B{交互模型}\n    B --&gt;|序列式| C[预测他人 → 自车规划]\n    B --&gt;|联合式| D[多主体联合轨迹分布]\n    B --&gt;|博弈式| E[纳什均衡求解]\n    C --&gt; F[执行轨迹]\n    D --&gt; F\n    E --&gt; F</pre><h2 id=\"基于图的场景表征\">基于图的场景表征</h2><p>城市交通场景天然适合用图结构表征：车辆和行人是节点，它们之间的空间关系和交互意图是边。图神经网络（GNN）在行为预测中被广泛使用：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>节点特征</strong>：位置、速度、加速度、历史轨迹、类型（车/人/骑手）</li>\n<li><strong>边特征</strong>：相对距离、相对速度、车道拓扑关系、视线遮挡</li>\n<li><strong>消息传递</strong>：每个节点聚合邻居的信息来更新自身的行为预测</li>\n</ul>\n<p>VectorNet 将地图元素（车道线、停车线、人行道）和轨迹都表示为有向多段线，统一编码到同一个图中。这种表征方式在 Waymo Motion Prediction Challenge 上长期占据榜首。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全性保障机制\">安全性保障机制</h2><p>纯学习式规划的最大挑战是<strong>无法提供安全性形式化保证</strong>。工程上通过多层安全机制应对：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>可达性分析</strong>：计算所有可能碰撞状态的集合，确保规划轨迹不进入该集合</li>\n<li><strong>责任敏感安全（RSS）</strong>：Mobileye 提出的形式化框架，定义了&quot;合理的最坏情况假设&quot;下的安全距离</li>\n<li><strong>运行时监控</strong>：独立于规划模块的监控器持续检查当前状态是否在安全包络内</li>\n<li><strong>最小风险机动（MRM）</strong>：当安全无法保证时触发预设的安全行为（减速、停车）</li>\n</ol>\n<p>这些机制作为独立的安全层叠加在学习式规划之上，即使神经网络输出了危险轨迹，安全层也会将其拦截。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从规划到控制的桥接\">从规划到控制的桥接</h2><p>规划输出的是期望轨迹（位置 + 速度 + 加速度随时间的变化），控制层负责将其转化为实际的执行器指令。主流控制算法包括：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>PID 控制</strong>：简单鲁棒，但在强非线性工况下表现差</li>\n<li><strong>模型预测控制（MPC）</strong>：在有限时间窗口内滚动求解最优控制序列，能处理约束</li>\n<li><strong>学习式控制</strong>：神经网络直接输出控制指令——在纯端到端系统中，规划与控制已经融为一体</li>\n</ul>\n<p>2026 年 Tesla 的纯端到端架构中，规划和控制不再有明确边界——网络直接输出方向盘转角和加速度，由底层线控系统执行。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>轨迹规划是在安全、合规、效率、舒适四重约束下的优化问题</li>\n<li>三代规划架构从规则到搜索到学习演进，2026 年主流是学习式规划 + 安全层</li>\n<li>行为预测从序列式到联合式到博弈式，交互建模能力持续增强</li>\n<li>图结构天然适合表征交通场景的多智能体关系</li>\n<li>多层安全机制（RSS、运行时监控、MRM）弥补学习式规划的形式化保证缺失</li>\n<li>纯端到端系统中规划与控制的边界正在消融</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"end-to-end-driving\">端到端自动驾驶</a> — 规划模块如何被端到端训练所吸收</li>\n<li><a href=\"../../graph-neural-networks/foundations/message-passing\">图神经网络中的消息传递</a> — 交通场景图建模中节点间信息聚合的理论基础</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"规划与决策算法","id":"规划与决策算法"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"三代规划架构对比","id":"三代规划架构对比"},{"level":2,"text":"行为预测与交互建模","id":"行为预测与交互建模"},{"level":2,"text":"基于图的场景表征","id":"基于图的场景表征"},{"level":2,"text":"安全性保障机制","id":"安全性保障机制"},{"level":2,"text":"从规划到控制的桥接","id":"从规划到控制的桥接"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读","id":"延伸阅读"}],"prev":{"title":"端到端自动驾驶","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/algorithms/end-to-end-driving"},"next":{"title":"车载计算平台","url":"/l-doc-books/h/data-science/autonomous-driving/systems/computing-platforms"}}